{"id":"18a85d97-e3c7-40a5-bb73-862dc644ad03","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"038dbf220bc88b8ee31e37d18f43723d088e2497","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"6d9d13853ee4d7fa"}},"payload":{"text":"What the editor reports to its API (packages/api/README.md, *Errors and timelines*, O4–O7), from the shell,\nwhich holds the sign-in:\n- the session timeline's events, signed in only (signed out, nothing), batched every few seconds: the page shown, a\nrepo loaded, and what the root and the workbench send as `session.event` (commands run, panes shown, runs);\n- every realm's uncaught errors (the root forwards them), and the shell's own, signed in or not, each answered with\nan id the person is shown, to quote. Signed out, the API keeps nothing of who but a daily IP hash.\nNot from automation (tests' browsers, `navigator.webdriver`) or a copy of the editor that can't sign in: their errors\naren't anyone's to look into. Nor once the page is going (`pagehide`): what fails as it's torn down — IndexedDB's\n\"The database connection is closing\", VS Code's log writes on it — is the leaving, not a fault.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:59.152Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:59.152Z"}
{"id":"21d49268-0ac1-4503-a3c1-90d261666456","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"defed7ef9e973c79","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ad66e3dca084f0a8515ac57a2142d6579f8888dd","start":1382,"end":1414},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","event","\"",":","(","event",":","Event",")","=>","void",";"]},"context":{"before":"0bc15211899e6e4b#0","after":"898fa4015b3b1093"}},"payload":{"text":"Something happened, for the timeline (and the next error's breadcrumbs).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:56.773Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:56.773Z"}
{"id":"596b3e5e-13b8-4d0a-a0c4-a8d84280a553","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"be017d21aed2e7dd#2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"584e698461f2385f6007339ee7769f825f818400","start":3388,"end":3411},"shape":{"type":"MemberExpression","atoms":["window",".","addEventListener"]},"context":{"before":"a39b2ed7cc8942d1","after":"3c1008b84cdd9c91#2"}},"payload":{"text":"The shell's own: nothing else catches them (its realm has no error tap).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:53.194Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:53.194Z"}
{"id":"937b5b1b-74fa-48a4-b6c4-3638c4485c61","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"94f68928b1dc57e4","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1edcbcb5fa5e9fe5167456320defcb0163a35d20","start":2389,"end":2488},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","quiet","||","leaving","||","reports",">=","REPORTS","||","now","-","(","recent",".","get","(","key",")","??","0",")","<","SAME",")","{","return",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"5fb23747776e0e1f","after":"1a15a93ba31c4d76"}},"payload":{"text":"The workbench's errors arrive twice (its own listener and the error tap's): once a minute is enough.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:54.408Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:54.408Z"}
{"id":"991cdd72-0719-441e-a56a-9c1f00bc4dcd","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"1acac8ead9c0cc06","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e998ba0288b7e726c63ddbf66d9f17f26d43e4a5","start":1860,"end":1926},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["window",".","addEventListener","(","\"","pageshow","\"",",","(",")","=>","{","leaving","=","false",";","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"a665f71d59966e1b","after":"4695d4529ad1c265"}},"payload":{"text":"(back from the back-forward cache, it's here again)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:55.570Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:55.570Z"}
{"id":"de44e5fd-c8f3-420a-bf78-51fdf78ad8ef","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"79c0cc9500ee6e0c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/reporting.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3054932b56eda64034dd9fa98429035a80c43d0a","start":1228,"end":1246},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","REPORTS","=","10"]},"context":{"before":"8f0f605199c973d4","after":"24b36cb9b78714f4"}},"payload":{"text":"At most this many error reports a page, and the same error once a minute.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:57.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:40:57.896Z"}
